  displayName: Kid with a lollipop
  lieChance: 0.15
  truthLines:
  - are you going to {dest}? i know that one. you wanna {dir}. i saw {a} from the
    bus. then {b} after. mom said that's how we get there. i counted the lights.
    don't tell her i talked to a car.
  - easy. {dest}. you wanna {dir}. {a} is on that block, i know it. then you see
    {b}. my school trip went past both. i wasn't supposed to look out the window.
    i looked anyway.
  - oh! {dest}! you wanna {dir}. there's {a}, and {b} too. don't go the scary street.
    this way is nicer. the lollipop is grape. that isn't a clue. i just wanted to
    say.
  - i know {a}. if you want {dest} you wanna {dir}. you'll see {b} after. i wasn't
    supposed to talk to cars. but you asked. sort of. the window is down. that counts.
  - yeah. {dest}. you wanna {dir}. then you see {a}, and {b}. i counted the lights
    by {a} last week. mom said i did good. i am doing good again. bye.
  - wait. {dest}. you wanna {dir}. look for {a}. then {b} is next. that's the one
    with the... the thing. i forgot the thing. but i didn't forget the street. promise.
  lieLines:
  - um. {dest}? i think you wanna {dir}. {a} was there. my friend said so. my friend
    lies about snacks though. so. maybe still go?
  - i wasn't supposed to talk to cars. but. if you want {dest} you wanna {dir}. look
    for {a}. that's the one. i think. the lollipop's in my eye. not really. kinda.
  - wait. {dest}. you wanna {dir}. {a} was on that block. maybe. i get blocks mixed
    up because they all have trash. not in a mean way. in a city way.
  - my friend said you wanna {dir} if you want {dest}, and look for {a}. my friend
    is eight. i am also eight. we are very sure. adults are less sure. that's what
    mom says.
  - maybe you wanna {dir} if you want {dest}. {a} anyway. that's the one. i could
    be thinking of a different {a}. there are two in my head. i picked this one.
  - um. {dest}. you wanna {dir}. {a}. bye. wait come back. i said {a}. that's all
    i remember. also grape. not a street. the candy.
